    "description": "Collection of preserved Boreogadus saida (Arctic cod) specimens collected during multiple German Arctic expeditions (PS80, PS92, PS106/2, PS122). The dataset contains morphometric measurements including total length (TL), standard length (SL), wet mass, sex, condition index, and stomach content analysis (stomach mass, stomach content mass, degree of digestion). Samples were collected using various gear types (SUIT trawl, RMT, ROV, hand collection, seawater tap) from Arctic waters, with geographic coordinates and depth/elevation data.",
